<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PRI Automation started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PRI Automation started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said Wednesay it had started coverage of PRI Automation Inc with a rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Billerica, Mass., maker of factory automation systems closed Tuesday at 48-3/4.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
